a middle drag 50 pixels up -> eye (-1 1 -2) ahead (0 0 1) right (1 0 0) up (0 -1 0); lens 2 near 0.01 far 1000
a right drag 50 pixels right -> eye (-1 0 -2) ahead (0 0 1) right (1 0 0) up (0 -1 0); lens 2 near 0.01 far 1000
home -> eye (0 0 -2) ahead (0 0 1) right (1 0 0) up (0 -1 0); lens 2 near 0.01 far 1000
home again, after the pan -> eye (0 0 -2) ahead (0 0 1) right (1 0 0) up (0 -1 0); lens 2 near 0.01 far 1000
home again, after the turn -> eye (0 0 -2) ahead (0 0 1) right (1 0 0) up (0 -1 0); lens 2 near 0.01 far 1000
the pointer moved, no button down -> eye (0 0 -200) ahead (0 0 1) right (1 0 0) up (0 -1 0); lens 2 near 0.01 far 1000
the wheel 100 steps in -> eye (0 0 -0.02) ahead (0 0 1) right (1 0 0) up (0 -1 0); lens 2 near 0.01 far 1000
the wheel 200 steps out -> eye (0 0 -200) ahead (0 0 1) right (1 0 0) up (0 -1 0); lens 2 near 0.01 far 1000
the wheel a step in -> eye (0 0 -1.8182) ahead (0 0 1) right (1 0 0) up (0 -1 0); lens 2 near 0.01 far 1000
the wheel two steps out -> eye (0 0 -2.2) ahead (0 0 1) right (1 0 0) up (0 -1 0); lens 2 near 0.01 far 1000

