## Camera.cpp/Grid::Grid
3 heights for 2 by 2, w held -> throws runtime_error: "ground: 3 heights for a grid of 2 by 2"
across along along, w held -> throws runtime_error: "ground: across and along span no plane square to up"
across along up, w held -> throws runtime_error: "ground: across and along span no plane square to up"
glide_speed 0, 3 heights for 2 by 2, w held -> eye (0 1 -3) ahead (0 -0.3162 0.9487) right (-1 0 0) up (0 0.9487 0.3162); lens 2 near 0.01 far 1000
no points, w held -> throws runtime_error: "ground: 0 heights for a grid of 0 by 3"
